            <title>GhostCue 1.9.4</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 21:56:07 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.9.4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.9.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Introducing voice-activated scrolling!</li>
                    <li>Split scripts into sections with the new section cutting button (Scissors)</li>
                    <li>Redesigned button layout for Notch & Cue Mode.</li>
                    <li>Play/Pause button now activates on first click even if speed slider is out.</li>
                    <li>1.9.2 — improved voice scrolling pace</li>
                    <li>1.9.3 — voice scrolling is now faster and more responsive</li>
                    <li>1.9.4 — better mic range with a mic picker, auto-advancing cue cards, click-to-rename section titles, and Start from Clipboard</li>                </ul>
            ]]></description>
